width:100%\" /></a>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"15\" style=\"height: 15px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td class=\"v\" style=\"padding: 0 3.5%; line-height: 1.75;  font-size: 17px; font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 1.75; color: #222222; letter-spacing: -0.1px;\">\r\n<p><strong>Simplify Workshop</strong> shows your team where it is misaligned and why it keeps happening.</p><p>Everyone leaves with one aligned set of priorities and a real kill list, built on the Confront, Delete, Amplify method. The whole team works through it together.</p><p><strong><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47929536.435305/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuc21hcnRicmV2aXR5LmNvbS9zaW1wbGlmeS10cmFpbmluZz91dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249c2ltcGxpZnktd29ya3Nob3AmdXRtX3NvdXJjZT1heGlvcy1maW5pc2gtbGluZSZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXItYWQmdXRtX2NvbnRlbnQ9d29ya3Nob3AtYm9vayZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aC391fc830\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more about the Workshop</a></strong></p>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  2. 🦩 Parting shot: Florida in full color </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><div align=\"center\"><!--[if mso]><img alt='' src='https://images.axios.com/-6oyzp4wh3QNvr16d0hVH2ngzQA=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/10/13/1791925479294.jpeg' style='display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;' width='558' /><![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.axios.com/-6oyzp4wh3QNvr16d0hVH2ngzQA=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/10/13/1791925479294.jpeg\" style=\"display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;\" width=\"100%\"/><!--<![endif]--></div> <div class=\"bodytext\" style=\"font-size:13px; font-family:'Gordita',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#848484; margin-bottom:20px;\">Photo: Nancy Broen</div><p><strong>A</strong> <strong>spectacular Florida sunset</strong> graces the sky in Babcock Ranch, America's first solar-powered town, in Southwest Florida.</p><ul><li><strong>🚲 Reader Frank Broen</strong> tells us his wife, Nancy, snapped this shot while the couple rode their recumbent tandem trike through the community.</li></ul></td>\r\n</tr> <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 25px\">   <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47929536.435305/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZmFjZWJvb2suY29tL3NoYXJlci5waHA_dT1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtNGRmODE5YjMtM2Y2ZS00NmE1LWJhOGMtNWU4ZWE2YmQ3Nzk1Lmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QyJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0RmYnNvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkyJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aC4dfeb30f\" style=\"display:inline-block\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-facebook-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Share on Facebook\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47929536.435305/aHR0cHM6Ly90d2l0dGVyLmNvbS9pbnRlbnQvdHdlZXQ_dGV4dD0lRjAlOUYlQTYlQTklMjBQYXJ0aW5nJTIwc2hvdDolMjBGbG9yaWRhJTIwaW4lMjBmdWxsJTIwY29sb3ImaGFzaHRhZ3M9YXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnVybD1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtNGRmODE5YjMtM2Y2ZS00NmE1LWJhOGMtNWU4ZWE2YmQ3Nzk1Lmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QyJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0R0d3NvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkyJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aCc8c7d9e3\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\